      "contextBefore": "```swift\nnonisolated\nvar customVideoCompositor: (any AVVideoCompositing)? { get }\n```",
      "contextAfter": "The custom video compositor instance that is used during image generation is accessible via this property after the value of [`videoComposition`](avplayeritem/videocomposition.md) is set to an [`AVVideoComposition`](avvideocomposition.md) instance that specifies a custom video compositor class.",
